{"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Framework","externalID":"AdaScripting","title":"Ada Script","symbolKind":"module","modules":[{"name":"Ada Script"}],"role":"collection"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/adascripting"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Ada Script is AdaEngine’s scripting layer for gameplay and ECS integration. Its source files use the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".ada"},{"text":" extension. The current implementation uses an embedded language runtime, while the public API, diagnostics, and tooling consistently present Ada Script concepts.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Annotations are not only syntax. AdaEngine resolves every query into native archetypes and component columns and publishes its component access to the scheduler."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Use Ada Script for gameplay rules that benefit from quick iteration. Keep rendering backends, custom data structures, and other low-level or performance-critical facilities in Swift.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["@system(scheduler: \"update\")","class MovementSystem {","    @query(Transform, Movement)","    var movers;","","    func update(context) {","        for (var entity in movers) {","            var position = entity.transform.position;","            var velocity = entity.movement.velocity;","            position[0] += velocity[0] * context.deltaTime;","            position[1] += velocity[1] * context.deltaTime;","            entity.transform.position = position;","        }","    }","}"],"syntax":"ada","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"AdaEditor projects configure automatic script discovery by default. For an existing Swift package, follow ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/GettingStartedWithAdaScript"},{"text":" to enable the build plugin and register the generated script plugins.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting"},"abstract":[{"text":"Write gameplay systems in Ada Script while keeping entity filtering and access planning in AdaEngine’s native ECS.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/GettingStartedWithAdaScript","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptBasics","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptLanguage","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptAnnotations","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptLibraries"],"anchor":"Essentials","title":"Essentials"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptECS","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptDiagnosticsAndPerformance"],"anchor":"ECS-Integration","title":"ECS Integration"},{"anchor":"Runtime-API","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptPlugin","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptSource","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptError"],"title":"Runtime API"},{"anchor":"Articles","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/NativeAOT"],"title":"Articles","generated":true},{"generated":true,"title":"Classes","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptNativePlugin","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptObjectReloadCandidate"],"anchor":"Classes"},{"generated":true,"title":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptNativeResources","doc:\/\/AdaScr